{"suttaId":"tha-ap481","source":{"db":"E-Piṭaka (dhammanana/epitaka_app)","book":"Ap-ii","vriCode":"s0510m2.mul","paras":[1757,1813],"vripara":"71"},"segments":{"tha-ap481:0.3":"Pānadhidāyakattheraapadānaṃ","tha-ap481:1.1":"“Anomadassī bhagavā, lokajeṭṭho narāsabho;","tha-ap481:1.3":"Divāvihārā nikkhamma, pathamāruhi [pītimāruyhi (syā.)] cakkhumā.","tha-ap481:2.1":"“Pānadhiṃ sukataṃ gayha, addhānaṃ paṭipajjahaṃ;","tha-ap481:2.3":"Tatthaddasāsiṃ sambuddhaṃ, pattikaṃ cārudassanaṃ.","tha-ap481:3.1":"“Sakaṃ cittaṃ pasādetvā, nīharitvāna pānadhiṃ;","tha-ap481:3.3":"Pādamūle ṭhapetvāna, idaṃ vacanamabraviṃ.","tha-ap481:4.1":"“‘Abhirūha mahāvīra, sugatinda vināyaka;","tha-ap481:4.3":"Ito phalaṃ labhissāmi, so me attho samijjhatu’.","tha-ap481:5.1":"“Anomadassī bhagavā, lokajeṭṭho narāsabho;","tha-ap481:5.3":"Pānadhiṃ abhirūhitvā, idaṃ vacanamabravi.","tha-ap481:6.1":"“‘Yo pānadhiṃ me adāsi, pasanno sehi pāṇibhi;","tha-ap481:6.3":"Tamahaṃ kittayissāmi, suṇātha mama bhāsato’.","tha-ap481:7.1":"“Buddhassa giramaññāya, sabbe devā samāgatā;","tha-ap481:7.3":"Udaggacittā sumanā, vedajātā katañjalī.","tha-ap481:8.1":"“Pānadhīnaṃ padānena, sukhitoyaṃ bhavissati;","tha-ap481:8.3":"Pañcapaññāsakkhattuñca, devarajjaṃ karissati.","tha-ap481:9.1":"“Sahassakkhattuṃ rājā ca, cakkavattī bhavissati;","tha-ap481:9.3":"Padesarajjaṃ vipulaṃ, gaṇanāto asaṅkhiyaṃ.","tha-ap481:10.1":"“Aparimeyye ito kappe, okkākakulasambhavo;","tha-ap481:10.3":"Gotamo nāma gottena [nāmena (sabbattha)], satthā loke bhavissati.","tha-ap481:11.1":"“Tassa dhammesu dāyādo, oraso dhammanimmito;","tha-ap481:11.3":"Sabbāsave pariññāya, nibbāyissatināsavo.","tha-ap481:12.1":"“Devaloke manusse vā, nibbattissati puññavā;","tha-ap481:12.3":"Devayānapaṭibhāgaṃ, yānaṃ paṭilabhissati.","tha-ap481:13.1":"“Pāsādā sivikā vayhaṃ, hatthino samalaṅkatā;","tha-ap481:13.3":"Rathā vājaññasaṃyuttā, sadā pātubhavanti me.","tha-ap481:14.1":"“Agārā nikkhamantopi, rathena nikkhamiṃ ahaṃ;","tha-ap481:14.3":"Kesesu chijjamānesu, arahattamapāpuṇiṃ.","tha-ap481:15.1":"“Lābhā mayhaṃ suladdhaṃ me, vāṇijjaṃ suppayojitaṃ;","tha-ap481:15.3":"Datvāna pānadhiṃ ekaṃ, pattomhi acalaṃ padaṃ.","tha-ap481:16.1":"“Aparimeyye ito kappe, yaṃ pānadhimadāsahaṃ;","tha-ap481:16.3":"Duggatiṃ nābhijānāmi, pānadhissa idaṃ phalaṃ.","tha-ap481:17.1":"“Kilesā jhāpitā mayhaṃ … pe … viharāmi anāsavo.","tha-ap481:18.1":"“Svāgataṃ vata me āsi … pe … kataṃ buddhassa sāsanaṃ.","tha-ap481:19.1":"“Paṭisambhidā catasso … pe … kataṃ buddhassa sāsanaṃ”.","tha-ap481:20.1":"Itthaṃ sudaṃ āyasmā pānadhidāyako thero imā gāthāyo Abhāsitthāti.","tha-ap481:21.1":"Pānadhidāyakattherassāpadānaṃ navamaṃ."},"attha":null,"tika":null}
